# Appwrite

> Appwrite is an open-source backend platform with authentication, databases, storage, serverless functions, messaging, and web hosting, available as a managed cloud service or self-hosted.

For AI agents and automation, use the tools below.

## MCP Server

Add Appwrite to Cursor, Claude, and other MCP clients so agents can call the Appwrite API and search the docs.

- [Remote MCP Server](https://mcp.appwrite.io): Hosted streamable HTTP MCP endpoint.
- [Self-hosted MCP Server](https://github.com/appwrite/mcp/blob/main/docs/self-hosted.md): Run the MCP server locally with uvx and a project API key.
- [MCP Server Card](https://appwrite.io/.well-known/mcp/server-card.json): SEP-1649 MCP Server Card for pre-connection discovery (/.well-known/mcp/server-card.json).
- [AI Catalog](https://appwrite.io/.well-known/ai-catalog.json): Domain AI Catalog listing Appwrite MCP Server Cards (/.well-known/ai-catalog.json).
- [MCP documentation](https://appwrite.io/docs/tooling/ai/mcp-servers.md): Setup guides for the API and docs MCP servers.

## Skills

Best practices for building with Appwrite in coding agents. Install with `npx skills add appwrite/skills`.

- [Skills Discovery](https://appwrite.io/.well-known/agent-skills/index.json): Machine-readable list of Appwrite agent skills.
- [Skills repository](https://github.com/appwrite/skills): Source for all Appwrite agent skills.
- [appwrite-cli](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/appwrite/skills/main/skills/appwrite-cli/SKILL.md): Appwrite CLI skill. Use when managing Appwrite projects from the command line. Covers installation, login, project initialization, multi-file project configuration, deploying functions/sites/tables/buckets/teams/webhooks/topics, flag-based list queries, non-interactive CI/CD mode, and generating type-safe SDKs.
- [appwrite-dart](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/appwrite/skills/main/skills/appwrite-dart/SKILL.md): Appwrite Dart SDK skill. Use when building Flutter apps (mobile, web, desktop) or server-side Dart applications with Appwrite. Covers client-side auth (email, OAuth), database queries, file uploads with native file handling, real-time subscriptions, and server-side admin via API keys for user management, database administration, storage, and functions.
- [appwrite-dotnet](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/appwrite/skills/main/skills/appwrite-dotnet/SKILL.md): Appwrite .NET SDK skill. Use when building server-side C# or .NET applications with Appwrite, including ASP.NET and Blazor integrations. Covers user management, database/table CRUD, file storage, and functions via API keys.
- [appwrite-go](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/appwrite/skills/main/skills/appwrite-go/SKILL.md): Appwrite Go SDK skill. Use when building server-side Go applications with Appwrite. Covers user management, database/table CRUD, file storage, and functions via API keys. Uses per-service packages and functional options pattern.
- [appwrite-kotlin](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/appwrite/skills/main/skills/appwrite-kotlin/SKILL.md): Appwrite Kotlin SDK skill. Use when building native Android apps or server-side Kotlin/JVM backends with Appwrite. Covers client-side auth (email, OAuth with Activity integration), database queries, file uploads, real-time subscriptions with coroutine support, and server-side admin via API keys for user management, database administration, storage, and functions.
- [appwrite-php](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/appwrite/skills/main/skills/appwrite-php/SKILL.md): Appwrite PHP SDK skill. Use when building server-side PHP applications with Appwrite, including Laravel and Symfony integrations. Covers user management, database/table CRUD, file storage, and functions via API keys.
- [appwrite-python](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/appwrite/skills/main/skills/appwrite-python/SKILL.md): Appwrite Python SDK skill. Use when building server-side Python applications with Appwrite, including Django, Flask, and FastAPI integrations. Covers user management, database/table CRUD, file storage, and functions via API keys.
- [appwrite-ruby](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/appwrite/skills/main/skills/appwrite-ruby/SKILL.md): Appwrite Ruby SDK skill. Use when building server-side Ruby applications with Appwrite, including Rails and Sinatra integrations. Covers user management, database/table CRUD, file storage, and functions via API keys.
- [appwrite-rust](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/appwrite/skills/main/skills/appwrite-rust/SKILL.md): Appwrite Rust SDK skill. Use when building server-side Rust applications with Appwrite. Covers async client setup with API keys, user management, TablesDB database/table/row operations, file storage, function executions, permissions, queries, and error handling. Uses the crates.io `appwrite` package and Tokio.
- [appwrite-swift](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/appwrite/skills/main/skills/appwrite-swift/SKILL.md): Appwrite Swift SDK skill. Use when building native iOS, macOS, watchOS, or tvOS apps, or server-side Swift applications with Appwrite. Covers client-side auth (email, OAuth), database queries, file uploads, real-time subscriptions with async/await, and server-side admin via API keys for user management, database administration, storage, and functions.
- [appwrite-typescript](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/appwrite/skills/main/skills/appwrite-typescript/SKILL.md): Appwrite TypeScript SDK skill. Use when building browser-based JavaScript/TypeScript apps, React Native mobile apps, or server-side Node.js/Deno backends with Appwrite. Covers client-side auth (email, OAuth, anonymous), database queries, file uploads, real-time subscriptions, and server-side admin via API keys for user management, database administration, storage, and functions.
